      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091414">SSE4_2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091416">Perform a packed comparison of string data with explicit lengths, generating a mask, and storing the result in XMM0.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091418">VEX.128.66.0F3A 60 /r ib</para>
      <para unique="1091419">VPCMPESTRM xmm1, xmm2/m128, imm8</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091423">RMI</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091425">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091427">AVX</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091429">Perform a packed comparison of string data with explicit lengths, generating a mask, and storing the result in XMM0.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
